UR5e开发

1. https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot
2. git clonehttps://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot.git
3. 
cd $HOME/catkin_ws/src

# retrieve the sources (replace '$ROS_DISTRO' with the ROS version you are using)
git clone -b $ROS_DISTRO-devel https://github.com/ros-industrial/universal_robot.git

cd $HOME/catkin_ws

# checking dependencies (again: replace '$ROS_DISTRO' with the ROS version you are using)
rosdep update
rosdep install --rosdistro $ROS_DISTRO --ignore-src --from-paths src

# building
catkin_make

# activate this workspace
source $HOME/catkin_ws/devel/setup.bash

4. 运行demo
roslaunch ur5e_l515_moveit_config demo.launch
运行gazebo+rviz
 roslaunch ur5e_l515_moveit_config demo_gazebo.launch （Terminal 1）

5. GAZEBO + RVIZ

To bring up the simulated robot in Gazebo, run:

roslaunch ur_gazebo ur5_bringup.launch

MoveIt! with a simulated robot Again, you can use MoveIt! to control the simulated robot.

For setting up the MoveIt! nodes to allow motion planning run:

roslaunch ur5e_l515_moveit_config moveit_planning_execution.launch sim:=true

For starting up RViz with a configuration including the MoveIt! Motion Planning plugin run:

roslaunch ur5e_l515_moveit_config moveit_rviz.launch

6. 加载相机+加载植物（直接将camera_model和greenhouse_gazebo文件夹拷贝到package文件夹中，catkin_make）

加载模型
roslaunch plant_creation test_plant_creation.launch （Terminal 2）

